<doc id="1880366" url="https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1880366" title="Andaz (film tahun 1971)">
Andaz (film tahun 1971)

Andaz (Bahasa Indonesia: Gaya) adalah film romantis India tahun 1971 yang dibintangi oleh Rajesh Khanna, Hema Malini, Shammi Kapoor, dan Simi Garewal. Film ini disutradarai oleh Ramesh Sippy. Film ini sukses dan penting dalam karier Malini sebagai aktris.
<h2>Plot</h2>
Plot.
Seorang janda Sheetal (Hema Malini) sedih setelah kematian suaminya Raj (Rajesh Khanna). Dia ditinggalkan seorang putera yang harus diasuh dan diajar di sekolah. Salah satu muridnya adalah puteri duda Ravi (Shammi Kapoor). Anak-anak menjadi alat dalam mempertemukan kedua orang tua tunggal ini
This film tells the story of a widow Sheetal (Hema Malini) who is left devastated after the death of her husband Raj, (Rajesh Khanna). She is left with a son to look after and teaches in a school. One of her students is the daughter of widower Ravi (Shammi Kapoor). The children become instrumental in getting the single parents to meet and fall in love with each other.
Anadaz adalah film terakhir dimana duo komponis besar, Shankar
Andaz was one of the last movies for which the great music directors duo, Shankar- Jaikishan composed music together. Jaikishan died of liver cirrhosis on 12 September 1971 at the young age of 42. "Zindagi Ek Safar Hai Suhana" (Life is a beautiful journey) turned out to be the last song that Jaikishan recorded before his death.
Andaz juga merupakan film terakhir Shammi Kapoor sebagai pemeran utama. Kesuksesan film ini disebabkan oleh Rajesh Khanna, Khanna hanya muncul selama beberapa menit di film.
also proved to be the last hit for Shammi Kapoor as a lead. The success of this movie is credited to the Rajesh Khanna Mania of the 70s, as Rajesh Khanna only appeared for few minutes in the movie, and still created a stir. However, Shammi's performance was well received and it is considered to have been one of the most uncharacteristic roles in his acting career. So also, Ajit played a sympathetic man who repents for his mistake not to accept Hema Malini as his daughter in law after the death of his son Rajesh Khanna.
